/E (The Department of Space, Planetary & Astronomical Sciences & Engineering \(SPASE\) at IIT Kanpur is dedicated to advanced education and research in space science, planetary exploration, and astronomy. It brings together cutting-edge work in instrumentation, observations, data analysis, and theoretical modeling.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
145 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E (SPASE offers postgraduate and doctoral programs, along with a minor for undergraduates, and promotes interdisciplinary learning at the intersection of science and engineering. Key research areas include planetary science, astrophysics, multi-wavelength astronomy, remote sensing, and space instrumentation.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [1]
>>
