152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 102 0 R
/T (The Space Planetary and Astronomical Sciences & Engineering \(SPASE\) is among the newest departments at IIT Kanpur. The department extends a warm welcome to you. Presently, PG programs are offered in the department. Our teaching methodology incorporates experiments and hands-on experience without sacrificing the rigour of the subject. The department's curriculum is multidisciplinary. Students are introduced to fundamental concepts such as fluid mechanics, radiative processes, and orbital dynamics, trained to understand optical, radio, and X-ray instruments, and the analysis of data relevant to space science & technology. Our students join us with diverse academic backgrounds with UG/PG degrees in computer science, electrical engineering, mechanical engineering, physics, mathematics, and geophysics. Our faculty members have led major projects of national and international importance and are collaborating with startups, industries and various government organizations like DST, ISRO, and DRDO. In presenting our students to your esteemed organization, I am convinced that you will find them to be well-prepared, brimming with enthusiasm, and capable of becoming future leaders.)
/E (The Space Planetary and Astronomical Sciences & Engineering \(SPASE\) is among the newest departments at IIT Kanpur. The department extends a warm welcome to you. Presently, PG programs are offered in the department. Our teaching methodology incorporates experiments and hands-on experience without sacrificing the rigour of the subject. The department's curriculum is multidisciplinary. Students are introduced to fundamental concepts such as fluid mechanics, radiative processes, and orbital dynamics, trained to understand optical, radio, and X-ray instruments, and the analysis of data relevant to space science & technology. Our students join us with diverse academic backgrounds with UG/PG degrees in computer science, electrical engineering, mechanical engineering, physics, mathematics, and geophysics. Our faculty members have led major projects of national and international importance and are collaborating with startups, industries and various government organizations like DST, ISRO, and DRDO. In presenting our students to your esteemed organization, I am convinced that you will find them to be well-prepared, brimming with enthusiasm, and capable of becoming future leaders.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
