/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 103 0 R
/T (Few industries are evolving as rapidly as the global space sector. From satellite communications and Earth observation to autonomous systems, scientific instrumentation, planetary exploration, and commercial spaceflight, innovation increasingly occurs at the intersection of multiple disciplines. Organizations today seek graduates who not only possess strong technical foundations, but also the ability to integrate scientific understanding, engineering design, and computational thinking to solve complex technological challenges.)
/E (Few industries are evolving as rapidly as the global space sector. From satellite communications and Earth observation to autonomous systems, scientific instrumentation, planetary exploration, and commercial spaceflight, innovation increasingly occurs at the intersection of multiple disciplines. Organizations today seek graduates who not only possess strong technical foundations, but also the ability to integrate scientific understanding, engineering design, and computational thinking to solve complex technological challenges.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
160 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 103 0 R
/T (The Department of Space, Planetary and Astronomical Sciences & Engineering \(SPASE\) at IIT Kanpur was founded on this very philosophy. By bringing together the scientific perspectives of astronomy and planetary science with the engineering principles that enable modern space technologies, SPASE offers a distinctive interdisciplinary environment where curiosity drives innovation and ideas translate into solutions. Our students are encouraged not merely to master existing knowledge, but to question assumptions, connect disciplines, and address real-world challenges with creativity and rigor.)
/E (The Department of Space, Planetary and Astronomical Sciences & Engineering \(SPASE\) at IIT Kanpur was founded on this very philosophy. By bringing together the scientific perspectives of astronomy and planetary science with the engineering principles that enable modern space technologies, SPASE offers a distinctive interdisciplinary environment where curiosity drives innovation and ideas translate into solutions. Our students are encouraged not merely to master existing knowledge, but to question assumptions, connect disciplines, and address real-world challenges with creativity and rigor.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 103 0 R
/T (Through research-led learning, hands-on engineering, and multidisciplinary collaboration, our graduates develop the analytical depth, practical experience, and professional maturity required to excel across aerospace, defense, geospatial technologies, scientific instrumentation, semiconductor technologies, artificial intelligence, and the rapidly expanding new-space ecosystem. They graduate not only with technical expertise but also with the adaptability, initiative, and systems perspective needed to contribute effectively from day one and grow as future technology leaders.)
/E (Through research-led learning, hands-on engineering, and multidisciplinary collaboration, our graduates develop the analytical depth, practical experience, and professional maturity required to excel across aerospace, defense, geospatial technologies, scientific instrumentation, semiconductor technologies, artificial intelligence, and the rapidly expanding new-space ecosystem. They graduate not only with technical expertise but also with the adaptability, initiative, and systems perspective needed to contribute effectively from day one and grow as future technology leaders.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
