/P 112 0 R
/E (The research focuses on developing scientific instruments and experiments for planetary exploration, astrobiology, and habitability studies. The lab investigates how life responds to extreme planetary-like environments and studies terrestrial analogue sites across the Indian subcontinent and surrounding oceans to identify robust biosignatures. By integrating electrochemistry, spectroscopy, imaging, molecular biology, and bioinformatics, the group develops compact and autonomous space payloads. )
