432 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 113 0 R
/E (Design and implement an automated real-time multi-messenger astronomical event broker that ingests and normalizes transient alerts from radio, millimeter/sub-mm, infrared \(NIR/MIR/FIR\), optical, UV, X-ray, and gamma-ray observatories, as well as neutrino and gravitational-wave detectors. The system will perform low-latency spatial and temporal cross-matching of incoming events against archival astronomical catalogs and heterogeneous multi-wavelength datasets, identify potential physical counterparts, characterize their observational and astrophysical properties, and rank candidates using configurable scientific decision pipelines. )
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
