/Title (The Department of Space, Planetary and Astronomical Sciences & Engineering \(SPASE\) at IIT Kanpur was founded on this very philosophy. By bringing together the scientific perspectives of astronomy and planetary science with the engineering principles that enable modern space technologies, SPASE offers a distinctive interdisciplinary environment where curiosity drives innovation and ideas translate into solutions. Our students are encouraged not merely to master existing knowledge, but to question assumptions, connect disciplines, and address real-world challenges with creativity and rigor.)
